      en: ["Historic center for the production of the world-prized 'Sugar Loaf' pineapple", "Eleuthera's fertile red soil is unique for high-quality cultivation", "Legacy industry from the 19th century once dominating global trade", "Economic and cultural heart of Central Eleuthera communities", "Focus of the annual world-famous Pineapple Festival", "Major attraction for heritage tourism and sustainable agriculture", "Symbolizes the islanders' historic connection to the land", "Supports local livelihoods through boutique and artisanal farming"]
