      en: ["Headquarters of the Bahamas National Trust in the capital", "Home to one of the world's largest private palm collections", "Features an 11-acre botanical sanctuary with 170+ palm species", "Established by the Langlois family as a horticultural retreat", "Major center for national environmental education and research", "Vital habitat for diverse native and migratory tropical birds", "Offers a peaceful green sanctuary in the heart of urban Nassau", "Symbolizes the nation's dedication to botanical conservation"]
