      en: ["Major national center for traditional sheep and goat farming", "Long Island is historically known as the 'breadbasket' of the south", "Traditional husbandry methods utilize native scrub and pastures", "Primary source of high-quality mutton for the Nassau market", "Economic heart of the island's southern and central districts", "Celebrated annually at the popular Long Island Mutton Fest", "Symbolizes the islanders' historic self-reliance and farming skill", "Essential for the preservation of traditional Out Island culture"]
