      ro: ["Rasa descinde din caii aduși de exploratorii spanioli.", "Ultimii cai rămași sunt ținuți într-un țarc protejat.", "Se fac eforturi pentru a salva rasa prin clonare."],
      en: ["The breed descends from horses brought by Spanish explorers.", "The last remaining horses are kept in a protected enclosure.", "Efforts are being made to save the breed through cloning."],
