      en: ["Unique boutique fragrance factory on Grand Bahama Island", "Produces perfumes inspired by native Bahamian tropical scents", "Located in a historic early Freeport pharmacy building", "Major center for the interactive 'Mix Your Own Fragrance' workshops", "Significant contributor to the local cultural tourism sector", "Reflects the blend of colonial charm and modern innovation", "Known for its signature scents like 'Guanahani' and 'Sand'", "Symbolizes Bahamian creativity in the global beauty market"]
