      en: ["Major national center for traditional Bahamian agriculture", "Known for fertile 'banana hole' farming in limestone terrain", "Primary producer of tomatoes, pineapples, and tropical fruits", "Economic heart of the island supporting hundreds of families", "Celebrated at the annual Cat Island Agricultural Show", "Maintains historic farming techniques passed down for centuries", "Symbolizes the islanders' resilient and self-reliant spirit", "Essential for the preservation of Out Island agrarian culture"]
