      en: ["First land and sea park in the world, established in 1958", "Covers 176 square miles of strictly protected marine habitat", "Global model for 'no-take' marine conservation areas", "Significant sanctuary for the endangered Bahamian Iguana", "Supports diverse populations of sharks, rays, and groupers", "Major international hub for marine research and eco-tourism", "Features some of the world's most pristine coral reef systems", "Symbolizes the national commitment to wilderness preservation"]
